<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-AUSTRIAN OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRIAN OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LINZ, Austria 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Austrian</p>
<p>Open women's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Alexandra Fusai (France) beat Anne Gaelle Sidot (France) 3-6</p>
<p>6-3 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Silvia Farina (Italy) 6-4</p>
<p>1-6 6-3</p>
<p>2-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat Andrea Glass (Germany) 6-7</p>
<p>(4-7) 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
